## You may

- Play the mod, in singleplayer or on any server.
- Record, stream and monetise footage of it. No permission needed and no credit required,
  though a link is always welcome.
- Include it in a **free, publicly available** modpack, provided the pack links back to an
  official download page (Modrinth or CurseForge).
- Modify your own copy for personal use.

## You may not

- Reupload the mod, or any part of it, anywhere. Link to the official pages instead.
- Redistribute a modified build.
- Reuse its code, textures, models or other assets in another project.
- Include it in a paid modpack, or in any pack behind a paywall, early-access tier or
  ad-gateway link.

